Calmer composer: no aura or glow, a bolt on the send button

The focused composer drew a dotted aura and a glowing halo around itself and
the send button carried a purple glow; both read as too playful for MariaDB
Code. The focused composer keeps only its accent border, the send button has
no shadow, and its upward arrow is replaced by the execute bolt of the
MariaDB VS Code extension (images/light/toolbar-execute.svg), filled with
the button's foreground color so it works in light and dark themes.

